# Paradox Engine: "Whenever you cast a spell, untap all nonland permanents you control." Sol Ring and three Moxen (with an
# Island paying for the Sol Ring) cast it, tapping all four. Casting Ornithopter afterwards untaps them, but not the
# Island, which is a land.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Sol Ring
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Paradox Engine
Ornithopter
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
